11. Expected Result

When a player visits Alva’s Home Screen and selects “Why Alva?”, they should see a polished, scrollable dialogue that explains the creator’s personal motivation for building the game.

It should tell a simple story:

A love of fictional worlds led to the dream of a crossover fighting game. Discovering MUGEN demonstrated the possibilities of creative freedom, but device compatibility prevented the creator from enjoying it. That experience inspired Alva: an unofficial, browser-based fan game intended to make this kind of imaginative fighting experience easier to access.

The player should finish reading with a clear understanding of why Alva was created and what it represents.

Implement the feature completely, keep all unrelated behavior unchanged, and report the modified files, test results, and any remaining limitations.
